How to Build and Run:

Steps (in Google Colab):
1. Set up runtime environment
    Go to runtime tab -> change runtime type -> set hardware accelerator to T4

2. Add CUDAbitmap.cu and test.bmp to the Colab workspace's files.

3. Start the program by executing the following code cells
    a.
        !nvidia-smi
    b.
        !nvcc -arch=sm_75 -gencode=arch=compute_75,code=sm_75 CUDAbitmap.cu -o CUDAbitmap
        !./CUDAbitmap